    "type": "question",
    "label": "36",
    "prompt": "Rewrite each non-monic quadratic expression in completed square form, $a(x+h)^2+k$, where $a\\ne1$.\n$$2x^2+8x+3$$",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$2(x+2)^2-5$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}2x^2+8x+3&=2\\left(x^2+4x+\\frac32\\right)\\\\2x^2+8x+3&=2\\left((x+2)^2-4+\\frac32\\right)\\\\2x^2+8x+3&=2(x+2)^2-5.\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
